{# *Events found in your folders* (0557): the folders `YYYY/YYYY-MM/<name>` not yet
   remembered, ticked; the user unticks those that are no event, then confirms: the
   ticked ones become events of events/<year>.toml, the unticked ones are remembered as no
   event (can be ticked back from the folded section). Batches are shown apart. #}
<details id="found" hidden>
  <summary id="foundTitle"></summary>
  <p class="muted">{{ _("Untick the folders that are not events worth remembering, then confirm: the ticked ones are written to the events folder beside config.toml.") }}</p>
  <p class="foundBar">
    <input id="foundFilter" type="search" placeholder="{{ _('Filter by name') }}" aria-label="{{ _('Filter by name') }}">
    <button type="button" id="foundAll" class="plain">{{ _("Tick all") }}</button>
    <button type="button" id="foundNone" class="plain">{{ _("Untick all") }}</button>
    <button type="button" id="foundSave">{{ _("Confirm") }}</button>
  </p>
  <p id="foundSaid" class="muted" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <ul id="foundList" class="foundList"></ul>
  <details id="foundRefused" hidden><summary id="foundRefusedTitle"></summary><ul id="foundRefusedList" class="foundList"></ul></details>
  <details id="foundBatches" hidden><summary id="foundBatchesTitle"></summary><p class="muted">{{ _("Their photos are far apart in time: a batch, not one event. Never proposed.") }}</p><ul id="foundBatchList" class="foundList"></ul></details>
</details>
